    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d540">

                <pb facs="0630" n="528" sameAs="frus:frus1933v03/pg528"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.93/299</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum Listing Certain Problems of Current Concern
                        in Relations Between China and the United States</hi><anchor n="46"
                        xml:id="d540-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-05-19">May 19, 1933</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1. American claims. Claims commission.<anchor n="47" xml:id="d540-f2"/></p>
                <p>2. Continued occupation by Chinese military forces of American mission property
                    (especially in the Hankow consular district).</p>
                <p>3. An increasing tendency on the part of the Commissioners of Customs in China to
                    punish offenders against customs regulations in a legalistic but inequitable
                    manner.</p>
                <p>In one recent case (at Lungkow) an entire shipment of kerosene oil belonging to
                    the Socony Vacuum Corporation was seized and sold because the transporting junk,
                    due to adverse weather conditions, had not complied with a customs
                    regulation.</p>
                <p>4. Desirability that there be no discrimination in purchase of airplanes.</p>
                <p>5. Ekvall murder case (Shensi Province).</p>
                <p>Simpson murder case (Kansu Province).<anchor n="48" xml:id="d540-f3"/></p>
                <pb facs="0631" n="529" xml:id="pg529"/>
                <p>In the Ekvall murder case, some but not all of the culprits have been apprehended
                    and punished.</p>
                <p>In the Simpson murder case, no one has yet, so far as we are informed, been
                    punished.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d540-f1" n="46" type="source" xml:id="d540-f1-content">
