            </note>
            <note corresp="#d540-f2" n="47" xml:id="d540-f2-content">
                <p>For correspondence on American claims outstanding against China, see <ref
                        target="#pg628">pp. 628</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d540-f3" n="48" xml:id="d540-f3-content">
                <p>William E. Simpson, an American missionary, murdered on June 20, 1932.</p>
            </note>
